  "title": "Bump @types/node to 26.6.5 across integrations",
  "summary": "A dependency-only change: the three integration packages (dsh, omp, opencode) each raise their devDependency on @types/node from 26.6.2 to 26.6.5, and pnpm-lock.yaml is regenerated to match. Because @types/node is a peer of several transitive packages (vite, sharp, @huggingface/transformers, @oh-my-pi/pi-coding-agent, protobufjs), the lockfile re-keys those snapshots onto the new version and pulls in a newer @babel/runtime (7.29.10) for @testing-library/dom. No runtime code, build config or published surface changes.",
